"Yulong has a keen nose and can smell out hidden cultivators' Qi."
"Yulong is Meiling's blood kin: his bloodline shares her green hair, purple eyes and freckles."
"Yulong sees Ri Zu as bloodkin too, by her purple eyes, freckles and green hair."
"Yulong's bloodline once ruled as emperors and built most of the hidden domains sheltering humanity."
"Yulong believes demons and jealous rivals hunted his imperial bloodline nearly to extinction."
"Yulong holds the current Crimson Phoenix Emperor to be a usurper of his family's ancient throne."
"Yulong wanted Meiling (code name Little Star) and her baby taken alive, to falsify their memories."
"Yulong is chief lieutenant to Jingsheng, the Imperial Realm Heavenly Demonic Master."
"Yulong's Master survives, badly weakened, and reaches Yulong only through dreams."
"Yulong is ordered to become the new Demonic Master and seek allies on Azure Dragon Continent."
"Yulong's demonic faction once tried and failed to recruit the foxes of the Howling Fang Mountains."
